function g000g Render
	doc "Draws one frame: the bricks (two-hit ones outlined), the paddle, the ball, the flashes, the score and the lives."
param renderer C.SDL_Renderer*
sheet body
node p01 Entry
node p02 Call C.sdl2.SDL_RenderClear
node p03 Get this.mBricks
node p04 ForEach
